      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "5549-5585",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "因为在这里郑庄公又集中地表现了他的伪善，而伪善是永远和丑恶伴随在一起的。",
      "totalCount": 99
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 36504456,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_5_2558-2590",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "2558-2590",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "文如果不能给人以鲜活的感受和某种情感上的打动，就很容易令人厌倦。",
      "totalCount": 84
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 349046589,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_426_682-748",
      "chapterUid": 426,
      "range": "682-748",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "夏宜急雨，有瀑布声；冬宜密雪，有碎玉声；宜鼓琴，琴调虚畅；宜吟诗，诗韵清绝；宜围棋，子声丁丁然；宜投壶，矢声铮铮然：皆竹楼之所助也。",
      "totalCount": 75
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 241544780,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_5_4783-4808",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "4783-4808",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "优秀的古代文篇，具有扩展和丰富我们的精神生活的价值",
      "totalCount": 60
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 239479575,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_8_1510-1528",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "1510-1528",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "公曰：“多行不义必自毙，子姑待之。”",
      "totalCount": 60
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 282523960,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_8_3259-3266",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "3259-3266",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "遂为母子如初。",
      "totalCount": 60
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 348684651,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_105_3809-3850",
      "chapterUid": 105,
      "range": "3809-3850",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "御史大夫公孙弘议曰：“解布衣为任侠，行权，以睚眦杀人。解虽弗知，此罪甚于解杀之。”",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 243571021,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_146_1938-1983",
      "chapterUid": 146,
      "range": "1938-1983",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "意遂更欲为国家讨贼立功，欲望封侯作征西将军，然后题墓道言“汉故征西将军曹侯之墓”，此其志也",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 2837544,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_155_4955-5058",
      "chapterUid": 155,
      "range": "4955-5058",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "古人思秉烛夜游，良有以也",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 433441108,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_366_7983-8122",
      "chapterUid": 366,
      "range": "7983-8122",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "始知文章合为时而著，歌诗合为事而作。",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 380876739,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_8_4867-4945",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "4867-4945",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "。争权夺利，可以使人变得冷酷无情，也可以使人变得骄横狂热。从本质上来说，它们都是封建统治者罪恶本质的表现。因此，这一对亲兄弟，犹如一根毒藤上结出的一双恶果，",
      "totalCount": 51
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 299178832,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_16_3856-3902",
      "chapterUid": 16,
      "range": "3856-3902",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "文章戛然而止，把赵简子的尴尬窘态等丰富的言外之意，全留给读者去想象、寻味，有言尽意不尽之妙。",
      "totalCount": 51
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 309443360,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_350_1268-1284",
      "chapterUid": 350,
      "range": "1268-1284",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "吾时虽能记忆，亦未知其言之悲也。",
      "totalCount": 51
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 42526865,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_5_2265-2338",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "2265-2338",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "像《战国策》记苏秦游秦，狼狈归来，家里人都不给他好脸色看；后来他游赵成功，得富贵荣华，家人遂对之恭敬有加，使得他感慨不已。这里面颇带有小说的气氛。",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 47541394,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_10_439-546",
      "chapterUid": 10,
      "range": "439-546",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "肉食者谋之，又何间焉？”刿曰：“肉食者鄙，未能远谋。”乃入见。",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 399102326,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_13_416-540",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "416-540",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "冬，晋文公卒。庚辰，将殡于曲沃。出绛，柩有声如牛。",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 62745511,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_25_4320-4391",
      "chapterUid": 25,
      "range": "4320-4391",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "批评太后如今只给予长安君尊贵的地位、肥沃的封地、众多的宝物，却不趁现在让他为国立功，树立威信；一旦太后驾崩，长安君凭什么保持他在赵国的地位呢？",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 399487077,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_248_2191-2211",
      "chapterUid": 248,
      "range": "2191-2211",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "暮春三月，江南草长，杂花生树，群莺乱飞。",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 42917495,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_431_2549-2577",
      "chapterUid": 431,
      "range": "2549-2577",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "又从而歌曰：“云山苍苍，江水泱泱。先生之风，山高水长。”",
      "totalCount": 48
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300029512",
      "userVid": 434461959,
      "bookmarkId": "3300029512_8_2562-2614",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "2562-2614",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "书曰：“郑伯克段于鄢。”段不弟，故不言弟。如二君，故曰克。称郑伯，讥失教也。谓之郑志，不言出奔，难之也。",
      "totalCount": 45
    }
